asc.env
# Resolved App Store Connect delivery credentials, including the private .p8 signing key.
# Materialized by `ProjectTool asc credentials generate`; removed by `… clean`.
# The glob also covers asc.auth.staging/, the directory a refresh builds before swapping it in.
# Left unanchored deliberately: for a private-key ignore rule, matching MORE paths is the safe
# direction, so a stray copy under any subdirectory is still ignored.
asc.auth*/

